  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — that Lottery B is more right-skewed due to a higher probability (99.9%) assigned to the unfavorable outcome (0 Euros) compared to Lottery A (99.8%) — is not considered or mentioned in the verbal report. The individual only notes a small difference in probabilities and makes the choice without referencing skewness or the distributional shape. The decision reason's rule — preferring the more right-skewed lottery — is not reflected in the justification provided. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason to make the decision. The assessment is that the reason was not applied.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
